# Claude Code local state: settings.local.json (per-machine permissions) and
# worktrees/ (background-task checkouts). Neither should follow the repo to
# another host. If a shared .claude/settings.json is ever wanted, un-ignore it
# explicitly with `!.claude/settings.json` — this pattern covers it too.
.claude/
